    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d357">

                <pb facs="0691" n="631" xml:id="pg631"/>

                <head>Mr. Plumb to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 233.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">City of Mexico</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-12-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 7, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In a letter under date of the 19th ultimo,
                    which I have received to-day from Mr. Ulrich, the efficient consul at Monterey,
                    he has inclosed to me a copy of the Periodico Oficial of the government of the
                    State of Nuevo Leon, of the 18th of last month, which contains the sentence
                    pronounced under date of the 11th of November, by the supreme tribunal of
                    justice of the State, in the matter of the outrage inflicted upon certain
                    citizens of the United States at Monterey, in the month of April last.</p>
                <p>I transmit to you herewith the copy so received of the said sentence.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. L. PLUMB.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D, C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d357-a1.xml" xpointer="d357-a1"/>
            </div>
